title: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Start with a referral or patient
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (Intake, Initial authorization or Retroactive authorization)
intro: The row of ways in at the top of Intake. Three bring a record in (Pull from EMR, Import a file, Paste a screenshot) and end in the same review with Apply. Referrals opens the incoming referrals in a side panel, with a drop zone for new referral documents. Known patient opens the patient search in a side panel. Typing straight into the form is the by-hand way. Everything shows only the sites in view.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: Reader's reading of a dropped referral is invented. The same file name always gives the same one of three sample referrals. A referral read from dropped files is placed at the site the person is working at.
---
start s1 "Open Intake on a new case"
start s2 "Click 'Use a different referral' or 'Use a different patient'\nor 'Add a referral' on Clinical documentation (opens ?ref= empty)"
screen sc1 "The row\n'Pull from EMR' (only when a clinical record system is connected at a site in view)\n'Import a file', 'Paste a screenshot' | 'Referrals 8', 'Known patient'\nA retroactive request has no 'Referrals'"

group gImport "Bring a record in"
  click cEmr "Click 'Pull from EMR'"
  click cFile "Click 'Import a file'"
  click cShot "Click 'Paste a screenshot', or press Ctrl+V or Cmd+V in the row"
endgroup
goto gEmr "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Import › Pull from EMR"
goto gFile "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Import › Import a file with field mapping"
goto gShot "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Import › Paste a screenshot"

group gRefs "Referrals, a side panel"
  click cRefs "Click 'Referrals'"
  overlay oRefs "Side panel 'Incoming referrals'\nDrop zone 'Drop referral documents, or click to choose'\n'Use sample referral'\nOne row per open referral at the sites in view"
  process pRows "Each row: initials and age, RF number, urgency (if not routine), source, channel, time\nStatus: 'Documents complete', 'N items missing', 'N items to review' or 'Waiting on the referrer'\nButton 'Review'"
  input iDrop "Drop files, or click and choose"
  click cSample "Click 'Use sample referral'"
  agent aRead "Reader reads, about one second a line, in the panel\nThe same reading as the full referral page"
  store stRef "New referral added with the next RF number at the site in view"
  click cReview "Click 'Review' on a row"
  process pRev "Panel closes\nAddress gets ?ref=RF-2045\nThe referral's checklist replaces the form"
  click cEsc "Press Escape, or click outside"
endgroup
goto gCheck "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Referral checklist"

group gKnown "Known patient, a side panel"
  click cKnown "Click 'Known patient'"
  overlay oKnown "Side panel 'Known patient'\nSearch 'Find a patient' by initials or case ID"
  goto gFind "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Find a patient and the authorization"
  process pPick "Picking a patient fills the form with their details\nNo second patient is made\nPanel closes"
  toast tPick "'J.M., 34 is in this case'"
endgroup

input iType "Type into the form: Initials, Date of birth, Payer, Level of care"
process pStart "The case counts as started\nThe stepper's Intake state follows"
goto gForm "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Patient, insurance and request rows"
endx eNone "Panel closed, nothing changes"

s1 --> sc1
s2 --> sc1
sc1 --> cEmr --> gEmr
sc1 --> cFile --> gFile
sc1 --> cShot --> gShot
sc1 --> cRefs --> oRefs --> pRows
oRefs --> iDrop --> aRead
oRefs --> cSample --> aRead
aRead --> stRef --> pRev
pRows --> cReview --> pRev --> gCheck
oRefs --> cEsc --> eNone
sc1 --> cKnown --> oKnown --> gFind
oKnown --> pPick --> tPick
oKnown -.-> eNone
sc1 --> iType --> pStart --> gForm
